<title>USA: Pudgie's Chicken to close seven stores.</title>
<headline>Pudgie's Chicken to close seven stores.</headline>
<dateline>UNIONDALE, N.Y. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pudgie's Chicken Inc said it will close seven unprofitable stores and lay off about 90 employees as it seeks debtor-in-possession financing.</p>
<p>Pudgie's, which filed Chapter 11 bankruptcy on September 18, also said it is exploring the possibility of &quot;strategic&quot; equity transactions.</p>
<p>Pudgie's sought bankruptcy court protection following an adverse arbitration award in a dispute with an area developer of its franchises.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
